## Example blueprint: Checkbox component

Goal: Mimic native checkbox semantics and behavior, styled with Becket tokens.

Requirements:
- Render an actual `<input type="checkbox">` for semantics and accessibility.
- Wrap with a clickable label area; support both controlled and uncontrolled usage.
- Expose `checked`, `defaultChecked`, `onChange`, `disabled`, `required`, `name`, `value`.
- Forward ref to the native `input` element (`HTMLInputElement`).
- Support `size` (sm, md) and optional `visual` variant via recipe.
- Keyboard: Space toggles when focused; label click toggles.
- a11y: WCAG 2.2 AA on the Default (and interactive) states. Proper `id`/`htmlFor`, `aria-checked` mirrors `checked` when needed, visible focus ring. Ship a Vitest axe test with the component (see **Accessibility tests** below).

React template:

```tsx
import { forwardRef, useId } from 'react';
import { checkbox as checkboxRecipe } from '@becket-ui/tokens/recipes';
import type { CheckboxVariantProps } from '@becket-ui/tokens/recipes';

type CheckboxProps = Omit<React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<'input'>, 'type'> &
  CheckboxVariantProps & {
    label?: React.ReactNode;
    description?: React.ReactNode;
  };

export const Checkbox = forwardRef<HTMLInputElement, CheckboxProps>(
  ({ id, label, description, disabled, className, ...props }, ref) => {
    const autoId = useId();
    const inputId = id ?? autoId;
    const descriptionId = description ? `${inputId}-desc` : undefined;
    return (
      <label className={checkboxRecipe({ /* size/visual props */ })} htmlFor={inputId}>
        <input
          ref={ref}
          id={inputId}
          type="checkbox"
          disabled={disabled}
          aria-describedby={descriptionId}
          {...props}
        />
        <span aria-hidden />
        {label && <span>{label}</span>}
        {description && (
          <span id={descriptionId}>
            {description}
          </span>
        )}
      </label>
    );
  }
);

Checkbox.displayName = 'Checkbox';
```

Story template:

```tsx
import type { Meta, StoryObj } from '@storybook/react';
import { Checkbox } from './Checkbox';
import { checkbox as checkboxRecipe } from '@becket-ui/tokens/recipes';

const meta: Meta<typeof Checkbox> = {
  title: 'Forms/Checkbox',
  component: Checkbox,
  argTypes: {
    size: { control: { type: 'select' }, options: checkboxRecipe.variantMap.size },
  },
};
export default meta;

type Story = StoryObj<typeof Checkbox>;

export const Default: Story = {
  args: { label: 'Accept terms', description: 'You can unsubscribe anytime.' },
};

export const Disabled: Story = {
  args: { label: 'Disabled', disabled: true },
};
```

